<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Taptiva — Remote Touch Control for Mac</title>
    <meta name="description"
          content="Turn your iPhone or Android phone into a remote touch controller for your Mac. Direct connection, no cloud, no accounts.">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #000;
            --bg-soft: #08090c;
            --card: rgba(28, 28, 30, 0.68);
            --text: #f5f5f7;
            --secondary: #a1a1a6;
            --blue: #2997ff;
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,.10);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    ellipse at 50% -20%,
                    #18243b 0%,
                    #07090e 38%,
                    #000 72%
                );
            color: var(--text);
            font-family:
                -apple-system,
                BlinkMacSystemFont,
                "SF Pro Display",
                "SF Pro Text",
                Helvetica,
                Arial,
                sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* NAV */

        header {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;

            padding: 20px 7%;

            background: rgba(0,0,0,.62);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);

            backdrop-filter: blur(25px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(25px);
        }

        .nav {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: auto;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 21px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: -.5px;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 28px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--secondary);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: color .2s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: white;
        }

        /* HERO */

        .hero {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 140px 24px 120px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            color: var(--blue);
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            margin: 0;

            font-size: clamp(58px, 10vw, 105px);
            line-height: .95;
            letter-spacing: -6px;
            font-weight: 700;

            background: linear-gradient(
                180deg,
                #ffffff 10%,
                #aeb0b7 100%
            );

            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            margin: 25px 0 0;

            font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px);
            letter-spacing: -1.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .hero p {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 25px auto 0;

            color: var(--secondary);
            font-size: 20px;
            line-height: 1.55;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            margin-top: 35px;

            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 22px;

            border-radius: 999px;

            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;

            transition: transform .2s, opacity .2s;
        }

        .button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .button-primary {
            color: #fff;
            background: var(--blue);
        }

        .button-secondary {
            color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
        }

        /* DEVICE */

        .device-section {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 20px 24px 130px;
        }

        .device-card {
            min-height: 460px;

            border-radius: 32px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);

            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 50% 40%,
                    rgba(41,151,255,.14),
                    transparent 45%
                ),
                rgba(15,16,20,.75);

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            text-align: center;

            box-shadow:
                0 30px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
        }

        .device-content {
            max-width: 650px;
            padding: 50px 30px;
        }

        .device-icon {
            font-size: 72px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .device-card h2 {
            font-size: 36px;
            letter-spacing: -1.5px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .device-card p {
            color: var(--secondary);
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-top: 18px;
        }

        /* FEATURES */

        .section {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 0 24px 120px;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 45px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 42px;
            letter-spacing: -1.8px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .section-title p {
            color: var(--secondary);
            font-size: 17px;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .feature {
            padding: 32px;

            border-radius: 24px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);

            background: var(--card);

            backdrop-filter: blur(25px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(25px);

            transition:
                transform .2s,
                border-color .2s;
        }

        .feature:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.2);
        }

        .feature-icon {
            width: 46px;
            height: 46px;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            border-radius: 14px;

            background: rgba(41,151,255,.13);
            color: var(--blue);

            font-size: 21px;

            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .feature h3 {
            margin: 0 0 10px;

            font-size: 21px;
            letter-spacing: -.5px;
        }

        .feature p {
            margin: 0;

            color: var(--secondary);
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.65;
        }

        /* PRIVACY */

        .privacy {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 0 24px 120px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .privacy h2 {
            font-size: 38px;
            letter-spacing: -1.5px;
        }

        .privacy p {
            color: var(--secondary);
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* FOOTER */

        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);

            padding: 35px 24px;

            color: #666;
            font-size: 13px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        footer a {
            color: #777;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 8px;
        }

        footer a:hover {
            color: white;
        }

        /* MOBILE */

        @media (max-width: 650px) {

            header {
                padding: 18px 24px;
            }

            nav {
                gap: 15px;
            }

            nav a {
                font-size: 13px;
            }

            .hero {
                padding-top: 100px;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                letter-spacing: -4px;
            }

            .features {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .device-card {
                min-height: 380px;
            }

            .section-title h2 {
                font-size: 34px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="nav">

        <div class="logo">
            Taptiva
        </div>

        <nav>
            <a href="#features">Features</a>
            <a href="support.html">Support</a>
        </nav>

    </div>
</header>


<main>

    <!-- HERO -->

    <section class="hero">

        <div class="eyebrow">
            Remote Touch Control for Mac
        </div>

        <h1>Taptiva</h1>

        <h2>
            Your phone. Your Mac. Instantly connected.
        </h2>

        <p>
            Turn your iPhone or Android phone into a powerful
            remote touch controller for your Mac.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-buttons">

            <a class="button button-primary"
               href="#features">
                Discover Taptiva
            </a>

            <a class="button button-secondary"
               href="support.html">
                Get Support
            </a>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- CONNECTION -->

    <section class="device-section">

        <div class="device-card">

            <div class="device-content">

                <div class="device-icon">
                    📱
                </div>

                <h2>
                    Control your Mac<br>
                    from your phone.
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Scan the QR code shown by Taptiva on your Mac
                    and connect your phone directly over your local
                    network.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- FEATURES -->

    <section id="features" class="section">

        <div class="section-title">

            <h2>
                Simple by design.
            </h2>

            <p>
                Everything you need. Nothing you don't.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="features">

            <article class="feature">

                <div class="feature-icon">
                    ⚡
                </div>

                <h3>
                    Direct Connection
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Connect your phone directly to your Mac
                    over your local network. No cloud service
                    is required.
                </p>

            </article>


            <article class="feature">

                <div class="feature-icon">
                    📱
                </div>

                <h3>
                    iPhone & Android
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Use your iPhone or Android phone as a
                    remote touch controller for your Mac.
                </p>

            </article>


            <article class="feature">

                <div class="feature-icon">
                    ◉
                </div>

                <h3>
                    Remote Touch Control
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Control your Mac using touch gestures,
                    a virtual trackpad, keyboard input,
                    and radial controls.
                </p>

            </article>


            <article class="feature">

                <div class="feature-icon">
                    🔒
                </div>

                <h3>
                    Private by Design
                </h3>

                <p>
                    No account is required. No cloud storage.
                    Your phone communicates directly with
                    your Mac.
                </p>

            </article>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- PRIVACY -->

    <section class="privacy">

        <h2>
            No cloud. No accounts.
        </h2>

        <p>
            Taptiva is designed around a direct connection
            between your phone and your Mac. Your control
            session stays on your local network.
        </p>

        <a class="button button-secondary"
           href="privacy.html">
            Read Privacy Policy
        </a>

    </section>

</main>


<footer>

    © 2026 Taptiva. All rights reserved.

    <br><br>

    <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>

    <a href="index.html">Support</a>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
